# Environment variables

Copy to `.env.local` for local development, and set the same keys in the Vercel project.

## Required for Relay (control plane, resolve, webhooks)

```
MONGO_URL=mongodb+srv://USER:PASS@CLUSTER.mongodb.net/
DB_NAME=nyttolabs
ADMIN_EMAILS=you@nyttolabs.com,@nyttolabs.com
ADMIN_PASSCODE=
RELAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
```

`MONGODB_URI` is accepted as an alias for `MONGO_URL`. The public website no longer 500s if Mongo is missing: it serves the in-code product catalog instead. Relay routes (`/api/resolve`, `/control`, partner inquiries) return 503 until Mongo is configured.

## Recommended

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://www.nyttolabs.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_BUSINESS_NAME=Nytto Labs
DEMO_MODE=false
CORS_ORIGINS=*
```

Point `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` at the public origin used in Relay `redirect_url` values. Production canonical is `https://www.nyttolabs.com`.

## Optional product URL overrides

Canonical live URLs are in `lib/relay/catalog.js`. Override only if a product moves:

```
PRODUCT_URL_CYCLETAG=https://cycletag.eu/
PRODUCT_URL_VIESPROOF=https://viesproof.eu/
PRODUCT_URL_GATEZERO=https://www.getgatezero.com/
```

Do not put personal inboxes in `supportEmail` / `partnerEmail` settings. The public site publishes only `hello@`, `support@`, `privacy@`, and `billing@nyttolabs.com` (partnerships use `hello@`).
